      {
        "id": 122307,
        "name": "SSJ3Godzilla",
        "username": "SSJ3Godzilla",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/db5fbb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-09T14:07:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In order: Shattered Timelines, Wrath of the Cosmos, Infernal Relics, Vengeance, and Rook City.</p><p>None of the expansions are bad, but Rook City is simply too unforgiving with some of the villains and the self titled environment deck. The heroes never really did it for me either until their dark watch promos came out.</p><p>Vengeance has some amazing heroes and I like both environments, but the vengeful five usually don't hit the table because my group feels they take to long and are fiddly.</p><p>The rest are very good expansions minus a deck or two here and there. They are simply ordered by preference.</p>",
