      {
        "id": 122310,
        "name": "cmschex",
        "username": "cmschex",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-13T17:10:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Agreed about the Vengeance environments, they remain incredibly underwhelming (i've only played with them a couple of times each post-playtesting). &nbsp;I was much happier about both of the environments in Wrath, as well as Omni-IV. &nbsp;I think anyone who wasn't happy with them in Vengeance will be very pleased with the new expansion</p>",
