        "created_at": "2014-12-14T02:41:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Infernal Relics and Shattered Timelines, because magic and time travel. &nbsp;</p><p>Then Rook City,</p><p>and Vengeance comes last, because I don't really like the way multiple villians plays (although I think that's because I don't spend a lot of time playing with experienced play groups, so I end up doing a lot of the managing for all the villian decks)</p><p><span>I haven't played Wrath of the Cosmos yet.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
