        "created_at": "2014-12-16T21:41:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Looks like Infernal Relics is doing really well in terms of popularity :D.</p><p>I'm sort of tempted to type out a thingy (not in this thread, just in general) describing my views on all the decks, what I think of various cards and in the case of hero decks, the way I tend to play them and any cards/combos I find super-useful and stuff...but it'd probably end up as a big long rambly thing with no real structure to it and I don't know if anyone would be interested since we already have a bunch of guides and stuff which are nice and thorough and have structure and stuff, and I think most people know all the cool stuff (or horrifically bad stuff, in the case of the villains and environments) that can come up among various decks, either in a deck by itself or in combination with any other decks.</p>",
